This plugin is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
(at your option) any later version — NOT the Apache-2.0 license the rest of
RelayFabric uses. The reason: it imports the official `meshtastic` Python
library, which is GPL-3.0 (the entire Meshtastic library ecosystem, and the
protobuf definitions it derives from, are GPL-3.0). A work that imports a
GPL library is itself GPL, so this plugin carries GPL-3.0.

The copyleft is isolated to this plugin's own process. It is a separate
process that communicates with the RelayFabric daemon (`switchyardd`) only
over the Apache-2.0-licensed CBOR-over-Unix-socket Plugin Protocol, and it
depends on the Apache-2.0 `relayfabric_sdk` (permissive licenses are one-way
compatible with the GPL). The daemon, the SDK, and every other RelayFabric
component therefore remain Apache-2.0; only this optional plugin is GPL.

